# Models

This directory stores trained models, model predictions, and model summaries.

## Contents

- Serialized models (`.pkl`, `.joblib`, `.h5`, etc.)
- Model metadata and parameters
- Model performance metrics
- Predictions and model outputs

## Usage

```python
# Save a trained model
import joblib
joblib.dump(model, 'models/my_model.pkl')

# Load a model
model = joblib.load('models/my_model.pkl')
```

> [!NOTE]
> Model files are gitignored by default. Use model registries (MLflow, W&B) or artifact storage for production models.
